  "body": "**IMPORTANT: Please disregard the previous 2021 sale price - this is not a reflection of the owners current expectations.**\r\n\r\nThe owners have loved their time here, but with the nest now empty, they're ready to downsize and move closer to the city. They're motivated to make their next move happen, creating an opportunity for buyers looking for a great family home in Silverdale.\r\n\r\nWith five generous bedrooms, three potential living spaces, three bathrooms and four toilets, there's plenty of room for the whole family. Two bedrooms have their own ensuites, while the downstairs bedroom, separate lounge and ensuite offer excellent granny-flat-style potential for extended family, teenagers or guests.\r\n\r\nOutside, enjoy a sunny north-facing garden, a great deck for summer entertaining and a vegetable garden. There's also an internal-access garage plus three off-street car parks - a real bonus in the area.\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat, with easy motorway access and the Hibiscus Coast Bus Station within walking distance. PAK'nSAVE, Bunnings, the local medical centre and early childhood centres are all nearby, and with the property recently zoned for Silverdale School, it's a great spot for families.\r\n\r\n**HERE'S THE OPPORTUNITY:** The owners are motivated, open to all offers and flexible on terms and settlement dates. They're ready to make a move, so don't assume this home is out of reach or hold back because you think your offer might not be considered. If you're interested, get in touch and put an offer forward.\r\n\r\nWith summer just around the corner, this could be your opportunity to secure a fantastic family home and be settled in time to enjoy it.\r\n\r\nConjunctionals from all agencies are warmly welcomed.\r\n\r\nTeam Lisa Westerby & Montana Northcroft - Selling over $200mil+ of real estate across 35 Auckland suburbs.",
